                   ifPhysAddress.1="00:02:b3:1d:1c:a3"

                   ifRcvAddressStatus.1.6.255.255.255.255.255.255=1

                   ifRcvAddressStatus[Integer:1,OctetString:ff:ff:ff:ff:ff:ff]=Integer:1
                     (with the --oo _v_e_r_b_o_s_e option)

                 ssyynnttaaxx
                   where the syntax string is one of: Integer, OctetString,
                   OID, IpAddress, Counter32, Gauge, TimeTicks, Counter64.

                 vvaalluuee
